e-to-life railway systems, every ride feels like the real thing.\nMaster different train models, stop precisely at stations, and prove your skills as a professional railway driver. Whether you\u2019re a beginner or a simulator enthusiast, this experience delivers the thrill of operating trains in virtual reality.\n\ud83d\ude86 Features:\nRealistic train driving physics and controls\nImmersive city environments and railway tracks\nPassenger pickup and drop-off challenges\nMultiple train models to drive\nDesigned for VR immersion on Meta Quest\nBecome the ultimate Railway Driver and experience the most authentic train simulator in VR.", "short_description": "Experience realistic city railway driving in this immersive train simulator."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/trainsimulator-privacy-policy/home", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Horizon Hub", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/horizonhubcom/home", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "331529188132278"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "24404677405860778"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 9, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "25944763315202047"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1641889493627963"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1635871480749053"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "2301280413682330"}, {"status": 